# Trivy ignore list for the Alauda trivy fork.
#
# Each entry must include: CVE id, why it is ignored, and a re-check trigger.
# Remove entries once the underlying package can be upgraded to a clean version.

# github.com/docker/docker (pinned at v28.5.2+incompatible) and github.com/docker/distribution
# (v2.8.3+incompatible) are reported with no fixed version, or with a fix that only exists on the
# new github.com/moby/moby/v2 module path (CVE-2026-33997 is fixed in 29.3.1 there).
#   CVE-2026-33997  MEDIUM  fixed only in github.com/moby/moby/v2 29.3.1
#   CVE-2026-41567  HIGH    no fixed version published
#   CVE-2026-41568  MEDIUM  no fixed version published
#   CVE-2026-42306  HIGH    no fixed version published
#   CVE-2026-85747  MEDIUM  github.com/docker/distribution, no fixed version published
#
# Re-check trigger: drop an entry once a clean release is available for the module, or once this
# fork migrates to the github.com/moby/moby/v2 module path with a release >= 29.3.1.
CVE-2026-33997
CVE-2026-41567
CVE-2026-41568
CVE-2026-42306
CVE-2026-85747
